{
  "bookId": "hero-214006",
  "id": "bond-26044",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26044001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "……这是……你给我准备的……办公室？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，惊喜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "……谢谢，惊吓多一点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "架子上塞满校规校纪，这我能理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "但连墙纸都是扣分统计表，是不是有点过了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那不只有扣分统计表。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有踢馆记录表。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你可以将每一次踢馆的战况都记录下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我还特意为未来的武道联赛冠军奖杯，准备了展示柜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "最重要的是——这里，《风纪委员演讲模板大全》。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还可以用照相机记录你在演讲台上的样子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哎？你去哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26044015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "找仓田龙马换房子！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "26044",
